>
> **Rules**
> - Always show, don’t just tell: every principle has a rewritten example.
> - Cross-language coherence; no buzzwords or hype.
>
> **Output format**
> - Principles table (“principle · yes · no · example”); axes table; lexicon lists; per-channel examples.

